        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon is an economic strategy in which you create and develop your own electric scooter rental company. Starting with a garage and a couple of scooters, you can build a real international corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Startup from scratch - buy your first scooters for your last $10,000 and start your entrepreneurial journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business management - assign cities for rent, monitor the condition of the fleet, hire staff and expand to new cities and countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realism and challenges - cope with vandalism and government requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible strategy - decide whether you will personally control the details or build a system that works without your participation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a small garage business into a leader in the global micromobility industry?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon is an economic strategy in which you create and develop your own electric scooter rental company. Starting with a garage and a couple of scooters, you can build a real international corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Startup from scratch - buy your first scooters for your last $10,000 and start your entrepreneurial journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business management - assign cities for rent, monitor the condition of the fleet, hire staff and expand to new cities and countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realism and challenges - cope with vandalism and government requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible strategy - decide whether you will personally control the details or build a system that works without your participation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a small garage business into a leader in the global micromobility industry?</p>",
        "short_description": "Build your own kicksharing empire from a small garage startup to a global company. Manage scooters, expand across cities, face vandals, rivals, and tough regulations. Every decision shapes your path to success—or downfall.",
